Dear Analyst,

Thank you for your interest in the Data Analyst Internship position at Insu=
reio. We are pleased to inform you that after reviewing your application, w=
e would like to invite you to participate in an interview to further discus=
s your qualifications and suitability for this role.

Our recruitment panel has reviewed your profile and believes that your skil=
ls and experiences align with our company=E2=80=99s needs. As a result, we =
have scheduled an online briefing and interview with a senior technical rec=
ruiter who will provide more information about the position and the opportu=
nity to discuss your background in greater detail.

To proceed with the interview, please follow the steps outlined below:
